{"id":8873214271956,"type":"artist","name":"Fancy","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/FANCY_2255.jpg?width=500","bio":"Fancy (nacido como Manfred Alois Segieth, en Múnich), es un artista alemán popular sobre todo a mediados y finales de la década de 1980. Su primer sencillo, llamado Slice Me Nice, salió en 1984.\nFue reconocido por sus éxitos como Bolero (Hold Me In Your Arms Again), Lady Of Ice, Chinese Eyes o Flames Of Love.\nTambién grabó algunos éxitos para otros artistas usando una variedad de otros nombres.\nCon frecuencia con el nombre de Tess o de Ric Tess ha escrito música para Grant Miller","tags":["Disco","80s","Italo Disco","dance","pop"]},"works":[{"id":107171565309164,"type":"song","name":"Wild Thing","artist":"Fancy","year":1974,"weight":4,"yt":"FcuIBmooE9s","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":206350144726225,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1974","rank":99,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":99,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":83078898534584,"type":"work","name":"Slice Me Nice","artist":"Fancy","year":1984,"weight":6,"yt":"Nlnoa67MUJU","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Loops 1 y 2","title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica (Javier Blánquez (ed.))"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":102608423514444,"type":"work","name":"Bolero","artist":"Fancy","year":1985,"weight":6,"yt":"sg9B_RnV8lI","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Loops 1 y 2","title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica (Javier Blánquez (ed.))"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":196785101994568,"type":"album","name":"Get Your Kicks","artist":"Fancy","year":1985,"weight":5,"yt":"aI9ZtXipKPI","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":145606244354059,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Italo-Disco","rank":29,"scaruffi":null},{"id":249926951024549,"name":"RYM Top — Electr